      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Solana vs Other Blockchains: Why Meme Coins Choose Solana</h1>
      <time class="text-sm text-gray-500">2026</time>
      
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">meme-coins</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>Discover why Solana has become the #1 blockchain for meme coins. Compare Solana vs Ethereum, BSC, and other chains for speed, cost, and ecosystem s...</p>
